      "description": "Sidebar row with a blue selected state and gray hover.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"작업 공간\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item ds-nav-active\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5 9-5Z\"/><path d=\"m3 12 9 5 9-5M3 16l9 5 9-5\"/></svg>전체 아티팩트</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" type=\"button\">내 아티팩트</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{background:var(--nav,#f3f4f6);padding:14px;display:grid;gap:3px;max-width:216px}.ds-nav-item{font-family:Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:9px 12px;min-height:39px;border:0;border-radius:7px;text-align:left;color:#414753;background:transparent;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:#e8eaef}.ds-nav-item.ds-nav-active{background:#dce7ff;color:#174fce;font-weight:600}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#2258e8);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Audience Label",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "scope-label",
      "description": "Static audience metadata combines a lock icon and text; it is not a button.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-scope\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10V6a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4\"/></svg>나만 보기</span>",
      "css": ".ds-scope{font-family:Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:400;background:#f1f3f7;color:#515b6b;border-radius:20px;padding:4px 8px;white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Artifact Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "artifact-card",
      "description": "Preview-led compact tile with title, owner/date, saved access and contextual share; no action footer.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-artifact-card\"><button class=\"ds-artifact-open\"><span class=\"ds-artifact-preview\">아티팩트 미리보기</span><h3>팀 작업 노트</h3></button><div class=\"ds-artifact-meta\"><span class=\"ds-owner\"><span class=\"ds-avatar\">F</span><span>작성자<small>방금 전 수정</small></span></span><span class=\"ds-card-scope\">나만 보기</span><button class=\"ds-card-share\" aria-label=\"팀 작업 노트 공유\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"m8.6 10.5 6.8-4m-6.8 7 6.8 4\"/></svg></button></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-artifact-card{font-family:Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",system-ui,sans-serif;width:340px;max-width:100%;border:1px solid #d9dde5;border-radius:8px;background:var(--paper,#fff);color:var(--ink,#18191c);overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease}.ds-artifact-card:hover,.ds-artifact-card:focus-within{border-color:#91a8d4;box-shadow:0 4px 14px #16233a0a}.ds-artifact-open{display:block;width:100%;padding:11px 11px 0;text-align:left;border:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;font:inherit}.ds-artifact-preview{display:grid;place-items:center;aspect-ratio:16/10;background:#f2f4f7;border:1px solid #d5d9e2;border-radius:6px;color:#626976;font-size:12px}.ds-artifact-open h3{margin:14px 3px 13px;font-size:17px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-artifact-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto 28px;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:0 13px 15px}.ds-owner{display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:#515b6b}.ds-avatar{display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;width:24px;height:24px;background:#e4e8ef;font-size:10px}.ds-owner small{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:11px;color:#626d7e}.ds-card-scope{padding:4px 8px;border-radius:20px;color:#515b6b;background:#f1f3f7;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap}.ds-card-share{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:30px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:#596170;cursor:pointer}.ds-card-share:hover{background:#eceef2;color:var(--ink,#18191c)}.ds-artifact-open:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#2258e8);outline-offset:-3px}.ds-card-share:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#2258e8);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sharing Option",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Flat audience radio row; draft selection is distinct from the panel saved-access summary.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-visibility\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10V6a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4\"/></svg><span><b>나만 보기</b><small>작성자와 관리자만 접근</small></span><input type=\"radio\" name=\"ds-visibility\" checked /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-visibility{font-family:Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.55;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;border:0;border-top:1px solid #eceef2;border-radius:0;padding:15px 10px;max-width:360px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink,#18191c)}.ds-visibility:has(input:checked){background:#eef3ff}.ds-visibility>svg{color:#5d6c84}.ds-visibility>span{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-visibility b{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.ds-visibility small{display:block;color:#697485;font-size:12px;margin-top:2px;line-height:1.5}.ds-visibility input{margin:0;accent-color:var(--accent,#2258e8);width:16px;height:16px}.ds-visibility:hover{background:#f6f8fc}.ds-visibility:has(input:checked):hover{background:#eef3ff}.ds-visibility input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#2258e8);outline-offset:3px}.ds-visibility:has(input:disabled){cursor:default}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Administrative Disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Native progressive setup guidance in a flat section.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-admin-disclosure\"><summary><span>설치 정보</span><small>관리 주소와 콘텐츠 호스트</small></summary><div>현재 설치의 연결 정보를 확인합니다.</div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-admin-disclosure{font-family:Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:600px;color:var(--ink,#18191c);border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e2e4e9)}.ds-admin-disclosure>summary{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 22px;padding:21px 24px 21px 0;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.ds-admin-disclosure>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-admin-disclosure>summary::after{content:\"+\";position:absolute;right:2px;top:20px;color:var(--muted,#626976);font-size:19px;font-weight:400;line-height:20px}.ds-admin-disclosure[open]>summary::after{content:\"−\"}.ds-admin-disclosure small{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted,#626976)}.ds-admin-disclosure>summary:hover{color:var(--ink,#18191c)}.ds-admin-disclosure>summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#2258e8);outline-offset:3px}.ds-admin-disclosure>div{padding:1px 0 26px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#626976);line-height:1.7}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Language Picker",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "language-picker",
      "description": "Native select with self-named locales, a language icon and shared focus; used in authentication, workspace and guest chrome.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-language\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 8 6 6m-7 0 6-6 2-3H2m5-3h1m14 20-5-11-5 11m2-4h6\"/></svg><select aria-label=\"Language\"><option lang=\"ko\" value=\"ko\">한국어</option><option lang=\"en\" value=\"en\">English</option><option lang=\"ja\" value=\"ja\">日本語</option><option lang=\"zh-CN\" value=\"zh-CN\">简体中文</option><option lang=\"fr\" value=\"fr\">Français</option></select></label>",
      "css": ".ds-language{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:var(--muted,#626976);min-width:0;max-width:100%;font-family:Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-language select{font:inherit;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;width:auto;min-height:36px;max-width:100%;padding:6px 22px 6px 7px;background-color:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line,#e2e4e9);border-radius:7px;color:var(--ink,#18191c);cursor:pointer}.ds-language select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#2258e8);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-language select{font-size:16px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Artifact Workspace",
    "overview": "Folio is a practical, contemporary workspace whose artifacts carry the visual interest. Cool gray navigation frames a white working canvas; clear sans-serif hierarchy, black primary actions and cobalt selection make finding, opening and sharing work easy to scan. Actual artifact previews lead the library, the reading canvas leads detail, and aligned flat sections make administration legible.\n\nThis records the built composition overhaul within the user's approved B light-neutral, black-and-cobalt world. Folio keeps its own folded-page mark and locally bundled Pretendard. At login, an original transparent blue-and-white paper sculpture shares the page canvas and crops freely across its edge; the form remains unboxed. On mobile the form takes priority and the artwork stage disappears.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Neutral operating chrome around visually diverse artifacts.",
      "Compact, preview-led browsing with contextual sharing and explicit access.",
      "A broad reading plane with a separate metadata aside.",
      "Flat, aligned administration and progressive setup guidance.",
      "Local typography and brand assets; direct task labels across five interface languages."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Action and State Rule",
        "body": "Use black for the main action and blue for selection, focus and active state; preserve their separate jobs.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Hierarchy Rule",
        "body": "Preserve the established heading and card-title hierarchy; compact metadata must not set the scale of the whole interface.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Depth Rule",
        "body": "Use borders and tone for ordinary organization; reserve stronger elevation for blocking overlays and transient feedback.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep the gray navigation shell, white canvas, black primary actions and blue active state together.",
      "**Do** preserve the established desktop/mobile heading scale and compact preview-led tiles.",
      "**Do** keep owner, modification time, audience and contextual sharing close to each artifact.",
      "**Do** give reading content the broad canvas and keep metadata contextual.",
      "**Do** use flat aligned administrative sections and progressively disclosed setup guidance.",
      "**Do** keep local fonts/assets, visible focus, honest states and the existing authorization controls.",
      "**Do** preserve explicit version, review and access labels, and let translated controls wrap or scroll within their region."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** restore the rejected sage/ivory, serif, bookish visual world or poetic library labels.",
      "**Don't** confine all brand imagery to decorative cards or bring the login artwork stage onto mobile.",
      "**Don't** restore repeated open/share tile footers or make a thumbnail viewport change with library view mode.",
      "**Don't** substitute fabricated activity, customers, usage or health metrics for actual state.",
      "**Don't** express sharing scope through color alone or imply that copying a link saves draft permissions.",
      "**Don't** treat uploaded artifacts, research references or example-tour styling as shell design tokens.",
      "**Don't** turn operational screens into a marketing landing page or replace real task content with decorative cards."
    ]
  }
}
